    <statement><tabular valign="top">
<row>
<cell>Match each function with its graph.
<ol>
<li>
<m>z =  4 \cos( \sqrt{x^2+y^2} )</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>z = (4x^2 + 2y^2) e^{ 1-x^2 - y^2 }</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>z = 6 x y e^{ - x^2 - y^2 }</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>z = \displaystyle - \frac{1}{x^2 + y^2}</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>z =  3 \sin(y)</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>z = |x| \, |y|</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>z =  3 \cos^2(x) \cos^2(y)</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>z = \displaystyle \frac{ 4 \sin(x^2+y^2) }{ x^2+y^2 }</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>z =  3 \cos(xy)</m>
</li>
</ol>
(You can drag the images to rotate them.)</cell>
